  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening plans aimed at the sustainable development of Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to provide support to the solution of the most immediate and important problems for the country, contained in the Government Plan of the elected authorities, based on disaggregated and differentiated data, evidence and information oriented towards sustainable development that enables the new administration design and implement inclusive strategic actions for the first 100 days of government.</narrative>
  </description>
